# Not for git, which never reads .git as content, but for act: it copies the working copy into every job's
# container, skipping what is listed here. .git is 1.1 GB (the LFS store keeps every version of the designs)
# and the jobs do not use it; on 8 October 2026 such a copy stalled Docker Desktop for half an hour. On
# GitHub actions/checkout fetches its own.
/.git/

